WEBVTT

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:53.670
Why was Takechi-sensei there?

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:56.680
There must be a reason.

00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:00.220
I still can't assume that Takechi-sensei is an enemy!

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:06.010
That's...

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:16.720
Not even a scratch.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.140
Hold on.

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:20.810
I see that kunoichi could be of some use.

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:26.300
She still has some value.

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.400
I was ordered to eliminate her.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:29.980
That decision is not mine to make.

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:30.560
What?

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.100
I've failed.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.370
This is the end!

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:02.540
Stop! Let Tsubaki-san go!

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:06.460
Takechi-sensei!

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.310
Tsubaki-san!

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:30.810
We can relax now.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.980
Thank goodness!

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:34.720
Thanks to the first aid you gave her.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:37.470
Himawari did a good job.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:41.440
What's wrong, Himawari?

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:42.850
First aid?

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:44.020
I didn't do a thing...

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.770
Trouble! Trouble!

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:51.820
Um... What's up?

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:55.410
Tsubaki was assaulted by Takechi.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:58.490
But she'll be fine now, Shikimi-san is attending to her.

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:00.850
Azami, what's the trouble?

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:02.330
Oh yeah.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:06.740
According to my information, the school has been closed indefinitely from today onwards.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:10.370
In addition, it seems that we don't need to turn in homework during this time.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:18.270
"Due to current circumstances, the school has been closed.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:21.370
Since we will open once again, you may be summoned at any time.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.670
Each and every person should standby in the village."

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:26.410
What does this mean?

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:31.480
Principal Yatsugashira, the other teachers, as well as Takechi have vanished.

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:34.010
We can't figure out what's happening.

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:35.690
This guy is the only one left.

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:40.860
Suddenly announcing that the school's closed...

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:43.250
What am I going to do about my living expenses?

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.750
Hayato-dono, didn't they tell you?

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:47.940
I don't know.

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:49.250
I just heard about it.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:50.990
They ignored you.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:52.210
They sure did.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:54.930
It's too cruel to leave me here by myself.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:59.280
Like I'm going to let them get away with my pay for this month!

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:02.660
Hayato's gone totally off-topic.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:04.460
I knew it would turn out like this.

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:07.710
Tsubaki-san!

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:09.610
You shouldn't get out of bed!

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:12.090
What do you mean by "I knew it"?

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:15.930
Ninja carry out their orders using any means necessary,

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:19.060
but launching a night attack is just low.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.170
My village has been burnt down.

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.810
That's Shinobi High School's...

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.920
Hanzou-sensei and Sasuke-sensei?

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.640
The attack happened last night.

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:44.780
It coincides with the teachers' disappearance.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.500
But that's...

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.830
Have you forgotten that Takechi sides with the enemy?

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:55.270
Because he exposed himself to us, he's unable to use the school as his cover anymore.

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:57.810
This explains why the school has been shut down.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.870
It's not just that.

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:03.330
They returned students to their villages,

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:07.820
and then captured the ninja they hadn't yet modified.

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:12.590
Then, does that mean you put yourself in danger just to tell this to us?

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:14.540
Hinata Himawari!

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.450
Duel with me!

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:20.820
What are you doing, so suddenly?

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:22.960
Looks like you were wrong.

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:25.960
I said something when I left this village.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:31.470
Someday I will return as a ninja worthy of Hayato-dono.

00:06:31.980 --> 00:06:34.170
I came to fulfill that promise.

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:36.070
Please, hold on!

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:41.470
Fight me. The one who can force the other to admit defeat, wins Hayato-dono.

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:44.860
You still want to duel her in an emergency like this?

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:47.990
That's absurd!

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:54.990
An exchange—until the outcome is clear, I promise not to speak or involve myself with Hayato-dono.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:56.590
Tsubaki-san.

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:58.690
Will you or will you not live up to this challenge?

00:06:58.690 --> 00:06:59.240
Wait!

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:09.230
It seems that I have to accept Tsubaki-san's challenge.

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:14.310
In the 19th installment of The Shinobis, "Yesterday's enemy is a friend today,"

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:19.260
Denzou-san also said that, in the end, we still must fight our own friends.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:20.620
Himawari.

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:22.350
H-Hayato-dono!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:26.220
Why are you running away? I've been waiting for you.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:30.070
Hayato-dono. Please don't get any closer than you already are!

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:32.430
You're being weird.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.260
Do you have any food?

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:36.710
The Principal as well as the others are gone, and they haven't paid me yet.

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:38.130
At this rate, I'll...

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:41.880
I can't talk to you right now, Hayato-dono.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:44.240
Nothing...

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:48.080
Although I haven't accepted Tsubaki-san's challenge...

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.750
T-Tsubaki's...

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.380
Is she here?

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:59.150
Anyway, I can't explain this to you because I can't talk to you, but I'm doing this in order to fulfill my pledge to you.

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:00.250
Pardon me, please!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:02.590
Hey,

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:03.800
Himawari!

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:07.430
What's with her?

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:15.260
We will follow the students,

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:18.440
and then execute the plan to eliminate all the remaining villages tomorrow.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:23.230
I'm counting on you to not let a single one of them escape.

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.190
Yes.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:28.690
You didn't tell me about this beforehand.

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:33.980
I wanted to prevent any leaked information from hindering our plan.

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:37.530
Isn't it obvious that the kunoichi Tsubaki, the one who escaped from you,

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:41.370
has contacted Himawari and her friends?

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:46.020
They have both met Hayato before, and have been rivals ever since.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:50.700
I intended to allow them to fight and crush each other.

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:51.710
I see...

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.210
I wonder if it will go as you planned...

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:59.220
I think it's a bit too aggressive to destroy the villages and capture the ninja.

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:04.720
It's fine. I am at the limit of my patience.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:13.060
I didn't expect Hayato-dono to be there...

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:16.610
T-Tsubaki-san!

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:21.040
Launching a surprise attack so suddenly isn't fair!

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:23.820
I don't care what method I use.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:27.950
I've vowed to make a marriage pledge with Hayato-dono.

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:30.560
A marriage pledge?

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:32.940
H-H-Hold on please!

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.780
Don't you mean a master-servant pledge?

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:38.900
After my village was burned down, and its people were captured and taken away

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:42.110
I realized that if you grow fond of a land and settle there, you'll eventually be destroyed.

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:46.190
Tsubaki-san, can't we talk calmly over tea?

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.530
You're too naive, Himawari!

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.010
I've noticed...

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:54.420
What's immediately required to save the Kazama clan from annihilation...

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:55.410
What I need is blood!

00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:58.200
Blood?!

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:02.050
Keeping the Kazama bloodline from dying out requires a husband and wife to procreate,

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:06.090
so I've realized that accepting
Hayato-dono as my husband is my duty!

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:08.450
To achieve that,

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:15.270
The Shinobis by Denzou, all fifty-two episodes.

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:17.840
Limited first release deluxe edition box set.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.640
W-What are you going to do?

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.070
If you want it back, duel me.

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:26.420
I-I don't want this!

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:29.680
Then, Denzou will burn because of this flame.

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.680
What will you do, Himawari?

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:42.210
Denzou-san is important to me,

00:10:42.210 --> 00:10:44.690
but Hayato-dono is irreplaceable!

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:46.230
Is that so?

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:48.700
Hold on!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.290
Hayato-dono!

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:53.160
Himawari,

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:54.720
are you really okay with this?

00:10:54.720 --> 00:11:00.560
To give up this Denzou's limited first release deluxe edition DVD boxset, just for me.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:02.300
Yes, I have no regrets.

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:04.760
I see.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:05.780
I've got it.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.040
Then give it to me.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:12.320
Listen, this thing can be sold for a good price on the internet.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.450
If you are going to burn it, then I'm taking it.

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:15.050
See you.

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:17.830
Hayato-dono, that's different!

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:20.720
P-Please wait!

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:22.060
He's the worst.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:24.560
Hayato-dono!

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:26.920
W-What's wrong?

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:28.930
That's cruel!

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:31.300
But I haven't been paid.

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:33.180
I need money for a meal.

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:36.920
Selling Denzou-san online just for your meal,

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.080
it's too much, even for you!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.490
Then,

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:42.850
can you talk to me?

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:44.840
Hayato-dono.

00:11:45.210 --> 00:11:48.950
See, I'm not a thing or a pet.

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:52.030
Betting me in your duel is trouble for me.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:57.290
Hayato-dono...

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:58.590
You went through all that for me...

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.430
Even so, what should I do?

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.710
Himawari and even Tsubaki...

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:12.770
What exactly about Hayato do they like?

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:14.920
It's beyond our understanding.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:19.220
They just want to avoid Hayato refusing to choose one of them, right?

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:20.910
I see.

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:27.960
If she sees Hayato as useless, then all that training will be for nothing.

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:30.890
So there's no turning back now.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.230
She's back.

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:37.080
You got Denzou back?

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.700
Azami-chan, um...

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.660
As for Tsubaki, she's left.

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:41.900
I see.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:44.090
But in the future,

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:46.740
we won't know when she'll attack you again.

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:56.450
Here it is.

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:02.620
Hayato has...

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:03.950
been captured by Tsubaki.

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:18.610
W-Why?

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:21.170
I-I don't taste good!

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:22.750
Hayato-dono!

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:24.250
Himawari.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.710
Hayato-dono!

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:29.210
Tsubaki-san. As promised, I came here alone.

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:32.330
Looks like you're finally getting serious.

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:38.330
That's the youthful side of Himawari.

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:39.760
What is she going to do?

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:41.720
Stay away, Himawari!

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:44.270
Please rest assured, Hayato-dono.

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:45.280
What?

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:50.030
Now, do with me as you please.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:53.890
I see.

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:55.380
She disappeared.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:57.910
Himawari!

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:01.130
I'll release you if you give up.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:03.790
Tsubaki, stop that.

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:04.900
It's unfair.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.020
Himawari, just say that for now.

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:09.360
N-No.

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:19.260
There's no way I could give you to a person who puts you in danger.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.940
How cool, Himawari!

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:23.350
I'm touched!

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:25.270
Hold on. Something isn't right.

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.650
What are you talking about?

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:35.790
Wasn't your plan to use Hayato-dono as bait and call me here?

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:37.750
Hold on.

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:38.620
What do you mean?

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:42.200
Everyone... You were here?

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:45.230
And you, why do you make it sound like this isn't your doing?

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.040
Your letter, here...

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:52.240
"Don't get fired up."

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:56.750
I got "Hayato-dono is under my care" from you.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:01.910
Looks like someone wants us to fight.

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:04.150
Who goes there?

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:10.870
So someone new has arrived, then.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:12.270
It looks weak.

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:13.950
It's soft.

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:16.590
I will take care of it.

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:26.170
Impudent.

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:29.810
Not even a match.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:35.890
Tsubaki-san, look out!

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:42.050
Huh?

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:43.830
I did it!

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:56.230
You...

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:07.370
It won't come back to life like this.

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:15.300
I-It's back.

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:20.630
I tell you, I have neither won nor lost, not even once.

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:23.120
Is it flattering itself?

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:24.970
Interesting.

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:29.380
Himawari, whoever beats this gets Hayato-dono.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:30.520
How's that?

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:32.820
Hayato-dono is not a thing.

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:37.150
But whoever put Hayato-dono to such shame is unforgiveable.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:44.480
Hold it right there!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.110
Looks fun!

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:50.990
Hey wait! What about me?!

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:04.130
If you want to bite, then bite here.

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.840
All right!

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:11.070
Ow...

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:12.840
H-Himawari.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.480
Hold it right there.

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.410
I'm in a hurry!

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:28.290
Isn't rushing like that the same as looking for trouble?

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:30.860
What's with you...

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.420
Himawari.

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:37.870
That's not even a fight.

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:52.980
Even or odd?

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.080
E-Even.

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:58.090
Pickles?

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.140
You're dirty.

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:01.740
How could it turn out that way?

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:04.200
I didn't intend to make a bet with you in the first place.

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:08.330
The dice are here.

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:20.810
It's weak, yet strong.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.390
There's no end to this.

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:26.460
Himawari!

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:28.200
Stop this!

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:29.560
Hayato-dono!

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:31.950
There's no point in facing someone not interested in fighting.

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:40.180
That reminds me, it hasn't attacked since the beginning.

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.900
Defense is the best offense.

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:44.430
It does nothing,

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:47.530
but it waits for its opponent to tire out.

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:50.780
That might be.

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:57.000
In other words, Hayato-dono...

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:57.690
Probably...

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:10.760
Takechi-sensei!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:11.900
You are...

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:15.230
So you've come out, the dice under the dish.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:26.570
A shikigami user, huh?

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:31.290
Editor's note: Shikigami means to animate an object to act as a proxy for or image of oneself.

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:29.760
Its true body is in some other place.

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:31.290
There's no way to win, right?

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:33.030
Why do you do this?

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.730
Wait Himawari.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:38.050
This person is the one who helped me back then.

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:13.780
If he had gotten there a bit later...

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:16.420
Are you sure you weren't dreaming?

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:18.530
It was no dream!

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:24.640
I remember the mark on your neck.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:39.310
You're the one from back then...

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:44.050
I saved you because I thought you might be useful.

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:49.630
I was planning for you to fight Himawari, and crush each other.

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:50.560
That's...

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:54.810
In order for Himawari to get into a fighting mood,

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:58.300
I caught Hayato and sent you the letters.

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:00.540
Hold on!

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:04.150
You aren't such a bad person.

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:07.270
That's because you are my...

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:10.110
You're my soul mate!

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:16.360
Actually, Hayato-dono was the one I latched onto,

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:21.290
but you are my true savior.

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:23.350
Latched?

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:26.610
Please, pledge with me,

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:28.060
and for the Kazama clan.

00:21:33.990 --> 00:21:35.540
You are interesting.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:36.570
Follow me.

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:42.530
Himawari!

00:21:43.590 --> 00:21:46.080
I give Hayato to you.

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:48.510
She dropped the honorific.

00:21:48.510 --> 00:21:49.450
Tsubaki-san.

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:00.160
She acts strong.

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:01.960
"Give?"

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.050
I told you, I'm not a thing.

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:07.900
Well, isn't it good for Himawari?

00:22:07.900 --> 00:22:11.320
Speaking of that, what were you trying to say to Takechi?

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:13.050
Nothing.

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:16.900
Anyway, it's good that things are all right.

00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:19.070
You worried about me?

00:22:19.070 --> 00:22:20.850
N-No way!

00:22:20.850 --> 00:22:24.280
I mean it's good that I didn't get eaten by that condor.

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:40.640
It seems that Himawari has gained quite a bit of strength.

00:22:40.640 --> 00:22:44.010
It's just that things are starting to get rushed.

00:24:11.170 --> 00:24:14.490
A travelling circus has come to the Village of Mist.

00:24:14.490 --> 00:24:18.380
The stall owners are all getting into a big fuss.

00:24:19.150 --> 00:24:20.060
Speaking of which,

00:24:20.060 --> 00:24:25.710
Yusura-chan and Yonezawa-kun said they wanted to watch the "lady of unequalled beauty" perform illusions.

00:24:25.710 --> 00:24:28.610
Isn't it nice for them to always be so lovey-dovey?

00:24:28.610 --> 00:24:32.450
But in order to protect Hayato-dono, falling in love is forbidden.

00:24:33.320 --> 00:24:33.930
Next time:

00:24:33.930 --> 00:24:35.980
"Bewildered and perplexed; surrounded by enemies."

00:24:35.980 --> 00:24:38.920
Hayato-dono. As I thought, love conquers all.
